<h3>Final Project</h3>
<p>Pick one of three tracks:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Reproduce.</strong> Re-implement a paper from the syllabus on a smaller dataset and verify a key claim.</li>
  <li><strong>Extend.</strong> Propose and test a small modification to a syllabus method — new dataset, ablation, or hybrid with another paper's idea.</li>
  <li><strong>Survey.</strong> Write a 6-page critical survey of a sub-topic (max 6 papers cited), comparing methods and identifying open questions.</li>
</ul>
<p>Artifacts: <em>2-page proposal</em> (end of Wk 3) → <em>4-page draft for peer review</em> (end of Wk 5) → <em>6-page final report + 5-min lightning talk</em> (Wk 6).</p>
